# Public website

- The site is a Next.js static export. Read domains and emails from `src/lib/site-config.ts`, not from components. [why: b27f5fa public website scaffold]
- Do not use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, `eval`, `new Function`, inline `<svg>`, or `style=` JSX. [why: b27f5fa public website scaffold]
- Keep `npm run csp:inject && npm run csp:validate` in the build script. [why: b27f5fa public website scaffold]
- GA4 `G-` and Google Ads `AW-` ids stay out of git. Push analytics through `src/lib/analytics/data-layer.ts`. [why: convention]
- Follow the `public-www-section` skill for pages, maintenance placeholders, and the env contract. [why: convention]
